  "reviews": [
    {
      "text": "Visited today, tried Sultania Halwa babka with hot V60, warm and tasty.",
      "author": "Shaikha A.",
      "stars": 5,
      "source_ref": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnNXFmd2V3EAE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loved the spanish latte. And the frensh chocolate croissant. I had to order their mini croissant box to try the diffrent flaver. Great for sharing and gathering. Also extra point for them, I order the mini box same day befor 4hr of my gathering.",
      "author": "Latifa A.",
      "stars": 5,
      "source_ref": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNUbXVXb2NBEAE"
    },
    {
      "text": "They have a good coffee and food. specially they have a very good bakery and testy . It’s very nice coffee and bakery ,, they make the every bakery fresh at same time and every time",
